PN,43702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1785383017
OL,3,CAnonymous tip-off line launched to
OL,4,Ctackle railway cable theft
OL,6,FThe rail operator said it hopes the
OL,7,Fnew service will encourage more people
OL,8,Fto come forward with information while
OL,9,Fraising awareness of the wider impact
OL,10,Fthe crime has on communities and the
OL,11,Feconomy.
OL,13,FJosh Hopkins, Head of Security, Risk
OL,14,Fand Resilience at Transport for Wales,
OL,15,Fsaid: "We're pleased to be launching
OL,16,FTfW Protect, giving people a simple
OL,17,Fand completely anonymous way to share
OL,18,Finformation about cable and metal
OL,19,Ftheft affecting our railway.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/4
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,438,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1785383017
OL,3,CAnonymous tip-off line launched to
OL,4,Ctackle railway cable theft
OL,6,F"This type of crime can have a real
OL,7,Fimpact on our customers and
OL,8,Fcommunities, and the information
OL,9,Fpeople provide can play an important
OL,10,Frole in helping us protect the
OL,11,Fnetwork."
OL,13,FPeople can report suspicious activity,
OL,14,Fincluding details of individuals,
OL,15,Fvehicle descriptions, dates, times and
OL,16,Flocations. Reports can also include
OL,17,Fwhat3words locations to help identify
OL,18,Fincidents in remote areas.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/4
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
