PN,43704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F437A1785383017
OL,3,CAnonymous tip-off line launched to
OL,4,Ctackle railway cable theft
OL,6,FThe service is operated by an
OL,7,Findependent charity and callers are
OL,8,Fnot asked to provide their name or
OL,9,Fpersonal details, phone numbers are
OL,10,Fnot visible, calls are not recorded
OL,11,Fand reports are stripped of
OL,12,Fidentifying information.
OL,14,FAnyone with information can report it
OL,15,Fby calling 0800 756 3477 or by
OL,16,Fcompleting an online form available on
OL,17,Fthe Transport for Wales website.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/4
